{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24060","headline":"送吕漳州 · 白居易","name":"送吕漳州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今朝一壶酒，言送漳州牧。\n半自要闲游，爱花怜草绿。\n花前下鞍马，草上携丝竹。\n行客饮数桮，主人歌一曲。\n端居惜风景，屡出劳僮仆。\n独醉似无名，借君作题目。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24060.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24060","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}